      <activity id="6996fa94-5fe9-51e2-b978-adb61422faba" activityNameId="f6394c2b-72b7-5c7c-960e-6e5270c34804" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Disposal, building, glazing 3-IV, U&lt;0.5W/m2K, to final disposal</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Disposal, building, glazing 3-IV, U&lt;0.5W/m2K, to final disposal
This dataset is applied for the disposal of 3-IV glazing of windows. ;
UUID: d918e918-6539-4b05-80d4-cf9e22cef987
The dataset describes the disposal of 1.06m2 triple glazing (3-IV) (not laminated safety glass) in a municipal incineration. 80% of the glass goes for landfill, 20% to MSWI. 1.06m2 corresponds to 1m2 visible glass.
Location: Data estimated according to Swiss practice.
Technology: The technology described involves the disposal of aluminium, rubber and glass of a 3-IV glazing in a municipal incineration plant (glass is partly landfilled).
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Calculation from waste composition 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that this dataset is representative for the whole Europe is taken into account in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d918e918-6539-4b05-80d4-cf9e22cef987.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
